omical double-bundle anterior cruciate ligament reconstruction</article-title><source>Sports Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>99</fpage><lpage>108</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16464119</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2165/00007256-200636020-00001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gill</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Steadman</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Anterior cruciate ligament reconstruction the two incision technique</article-title><source>Orthop Clin North Am</source><year>2002</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>727</fpage><lpage>735</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12528914</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0030-5898(02)00030-5</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Flik</surname><given-names>KR</given-names></name><name><surname>Bach</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Anterior cruciate ligament reconstruction using the two-incision arthroscopy-assisted technique with patellar tendon autograft</article-title><source>Techniques in Orthopaedics</source><year>2005</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>372</fpage><lpage>376</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.bto.0000190270.70044.77</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>